# ── Binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The built CLI (`make build` / `go build -o nullbox`). Anchored to the repo
# root with a leading slash so the cmd/nullbox/ source package is NOT ignored.
/nullbox
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# ── GoReleaser / release output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/dist/

# ── Test & coverage output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.test
*.out
*.prof
*.cover
coverage.*

# ── Go workspace & vendoring (go.mod and go.sum ARE committed) ───────────────
go.work
go.work.sum
/vendor/

# ── Secrets / local config ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ── Editors / IDEs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
